WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:46.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:47.000 --> 01:51.800
[Episode 13]

3
01:56.640 --> 01:58.840
Since this is your heart,

4
01:59.746 --> 02:02.520
how could I bear to wash it away?

5
02:02.520 --> 02:05.260
How could I bear to lose it again?

6
02:06.280 --> 02:08.159
What's done is done.

7
02:08.159 --> 02:11.260
Stealing this half hour is enough for me.

8
02:12.680 --> 02:15.520
I shouldn't pester Mr. Ji anymore.

9
02:15.520 --> 02:17.779
He has his own life.

10
02:21.199 --> 02:23.240
I'm leaving tomorrow.

11
02:23.240 --> 02:25.800
You should head back too, Mr. Ji.

12
02:25.800 --> 02:28.039
You'd better wash that off your hand.

13
02:28.039 --> 02:29.879
I don't want to cause you trouble,

14
02:29.879 --> 02:32.140
let alone have others misunderstand.

15
02:33.246 --> 02:35.146
Who would misunderstand?

16
02:35.760 --> 02:38.166
And what trouble could you cause me?

17
02:38.166 --> 02:40.840
Even though Mrs. Ji isn't here, but...

18
02:40.840 --> 02:43.180
Who said I'm married?

19
02:46.840 --> 02:48.539
You're not?

20
02:54.039 --> 02:56.580
If I were married,

21
02:57.350 --> 02:59.759
how could this spot still be vacant?

22
02:59.759 --> 03:02.320
Then Xiao Ning is...

23
03:02.320 --> 03:07.712
Can't the father of a three-year-old still be single?

24
03:08.319 --> 03:10.159
Of course, that's possible.

25
03:10.159 --> 03:11.919
For instance, a child out of wedlock,

26
03:11.919 --> 03:14.240
or perhaps a divorce.

27
03:14.240 --> 03:16.099
Or maybe...

28
03:27.319 --> 03:29.160
Shen Mo.

29
03:29.160 --> 03:30.859
Yeah?

30
03:40.560 --> 03:43.400
There is no Mrs. Ji.

31
03:43.400 --> 03:45.340
Even if there were,

32
03:46.120 --> 03:48.899
it could only be the person before me.

33
03:50.280 --> 03:52.460
Having experienced the best,

34
03:53.600 --> 03:56.541
how could I bear to lose him again?

35
03:58.800 --> 04:01.086
Why?

36
04:01.086 --> 04:02.680
There's only one thing in this world

37
04:02.680 --> 04:05.639
that can't be hidden no matter what.

38
04:05.639 --> 04:07.520
Even if you don't say a word,

39
04:07.520 --> 04:11.140
your eyes will give it away.

40
04:31.879 --> 04:33.620
Mr. Ji...

41
04:51.879 --> 04:53.580
Too formal.

42
05:01.120 --> 05:02.800
Call me...

43
05:15.040 --> 05:16.600
Ming Xuan.

44
05:16.600 --> 05:18.300
Ming Xuan.

45
05:21.720 --> 05:23.419
Take me.

46
05:27.200 --> 05:28.980
Louder.

47
05:39.199 --> 05:41.560
Take... Take me.

48
05:41.560 --> 05:43.099
Ming Xuan.

49
05:47.560 --> 05:49.260
Ming Xuan.

50
06:10.680 --> 06:12.859
You're mine now.

51
06:15.800 --> 06:17.661
I always have been.

52
06:34.279 --> 06:36.526
Mr. Ji.

53
06:36.526 --> 06:38.707
Are you really not married?

54
06:40.400 --> 06:42.860
You know who's in my heart.

55
06:43.800 --> 06:45.779
If that's the case,

56
06:46.600 --> 06:49.320
why did you disappear four years ago?

57
06:49.959 --> 06:52.080
I asked Lawyer Chen to contact you.

58
06:52.080 --> 06:54.621
Why did you never reply to me?

59
06:55.720 --> 06:57.419
Huh?

60
07:00.040 --> 07:02.060
It's all my fault.

61
07:06.160 --> 07:08.887
That day, An An woke up in the hospital.

62
07:10.038 --> 07:13.019
After hearing the whole truth from me,

63
07:14.040 --> 07:16.420
she didn't shed a single tear.

64
07:18.040 --> 07:20.700
An An has always been a crybaby,

65
07:21.759 --> 07:24.380
but she was so calm at that time.

66
07:26.000 --> 07:27.980
After she woke up,

67
07:29.787 --> 07:32.046
she only asked me for one thing.

68
07:32.900 --> 07:34.120
What was it?

69
07:34.120 --> 07:36.399
Ever since we were little,

70
07:36.399 --> 07:39.280
whenever An An wanted something,

71
07:39.280 --> 07:41.940
I would do my best to make it happen.

72
07:43.480 --> 07:46.020
I hated Zhou Yang so much,

73
07:46.633 --> 07:49.299
yet I agreed to let him be my brother-in-law.

74
07:53.000 --> 07:56.141
It was the first time she begged me so seriously.

75
07:58.000 --> 08:00.340
I couldn't let her down.

76
08:04.439 --> 08:06.140
Big Brother.

77
08:07.319 --> 08:09.659
Set Shen Mo free.

78
08:10.279 --> 08:11.979
Okay.

79
08:14.320 --> 08:16.979
Let Shen Mo and Zhou Yang be together.

80
08:21.920 --> 08:23.399
An An.

81
08:23.399 --> 08:26.199
What about you and... Zhou Yang?

82
08:26.199 --> 08:27.900
Actually...

83
08:28.639 --> 08:30.279
I've felt it a long time ago.

84
08:30.279 --> 08:33.000
Zhou Yang doesn't love me anymore.

85
08:33.000 --> 08:35.080
All right, An An.

86
08:35.080 --> 08:36.360
Don't think about that now.

87
08:36.360 --> 08:37.799
Big Brother.

88
08:37.799 --> 08:39.539
I'm fine.

89
08:42.519 --> 08:47.699
Actually, it was you who insisted on keeping Zhou Yang by my side.

90
08:48.679 --> 08:51.260
I've figured it out now.

91
08:51.879 --> 08:55.380
Two people who love each other should be together.

92
08:56.000 --> 08:58.360
The one who isn't loved

93
08:58.360 --> 09:00.740
can only let go.

94
09:02.399 --> 09:04.100
An An.

95
09:05.360 --> 09:08.080
That's how it is for me.

96
09:08.080 --> 09:10.939
And it's the same for you.

97
09:12.000 --> 09:13.680
Fine.

98
09:15.159 --> 09:16.980
I promise you.

99
09:18.960 --> 09:21.059
I'll set Shen Mo free.

100
09:22.200 --> 09:24.860
From now on, I won't disturb Shen Mo...

101
09:26.820 --> 09:28.439
or Zhou Yang ever again.

102
09:30.679 --> 09:32.519
And you called me a fool for love.

103
09:32.519 --> 09:34.860
I think you're one, too.

104
09:44.280 --> 09:45.960
Clearly...

105
09:48.560 --> 09:52.092
Clearly, she was the one who was deceived by everyone.

106
09:52.092 --> 09:54.120
But she was much more clear-headed than me.

107
09:54.120 --> 09:55.861
Wasn't she?

108
09:56.960 --> 09:59.120
I used to think that

109
09:59.120 --> 10:00.320
if I forced two people together,

110
10:00.320 --> 10:03.059
feelings would eventually develop.

111
10:05.279 --> 10:07.912
I didn't expect it to backfire.

112
10:07.912 --> 10:11.040
I exposed the truth about you and Zhou Yang,

113
10:11.040 --> 10:13.381
which ended up hurting you.

114
10:15.880 --> 10:18.940
I made An An get engaged to Zhou Yang,

115
10:21.120 --> 10:23.140
and in the end, she...

116
10:25.440 --> 10:27.140
No.

117
10:28.120 --> 10:30.520
I know you didn't mean for that to happen.

118
10:30.520 --> 10:33.960
But what happened, happened.

119
10:36.080 --> 10:38.039
It can't be changed.

120
10:38.039 --> 10:40.840
That's why I never contacted you again

121
10:40.840 --> 10:43.792
and completely disappeared from your life.

122
10:43.792 --> 10:45.733
I thought...

123
10:47.360 --> 10:49.779
you and Zhou Yang would reconcile.

124
10:50.639 --> 10:52.340
Zhou Yang and I

125
10:53.559 --> 10:56.080
were over a long time ago.

126
10:56.080 --> 10:58.639
I should have believed you sooner.

127
10:58.639 --> 11:02.020
I didn't expect to run into you here.

128
11:04.600 --> 11:07.020
That day, you were by the pool,

129
11:08.760 --> 11:10.800
just standing there.

130
11:16.080 --> 11:17.781
Shen Mo.

131
11:19.805 --> 11:22.146
You walked right into my trap.

132
11:23.879 --> 11:25.579
Yes.

133
11:26.360 --> 11:28.620
But that's because the person who set the trap

134
11:29.279 --> 11:31.419
was you, Mr. Ji.

135
11:32.519 --> 11:34.759
To set this trap,

136
11:34.759 --> 11:37.799
Mr. Ji even opened a hotel on M Island

137
11:37.799 --> 11:40.440
and waited for me to walk into it.

138
11:40.440 --> 11:43.260
Just like back at Jinxiu Mountain Villa.

139
11:48.519 --> 11:51.260
Do you need to go back to Xiao Ning now?

140
11:52.320 --> 11:54.527
Stay and lie with me a while longer.

141
11:54.527 --> 11:56.227
Okay.

142
11:57.240 --> 12:01.766
If you aren't married, then Xiao Ning is...

143
12:01.766 --> 12:03.679
While you were in the country,

144
12:03.679 --> 12:06.280
over these past few years,

145
12:06.280 --> 12:08.953
you must have heard news about An An.

146
12:08.953 --> 12:10.240
Yes.

147
12:10.240 --> 12:12.459
Lawyer Chen mentioned it.

148
12:15.000 --> 12:17.659
After An An and I went abroad,

149
12:18.799 --> 12:21.659
her condition had stabilized.

150
12:24.519 --> 12:25.919
But she...

151
12:25.919 --> 12:27.740
She wouldn't listen to me.

152
12:29.000 --> 12:31.260
She insisted on giving birth to Ji Ning.

153
12:34.879 --> 12:36.419
Just like...

154
12:37.120 --> 12:39.459
my mother did back then.

155
12:42.320 --> 12:44.340
So, Xiao Ning is...

156
12:45.040 --> 12:47.320
Ms. Ji's child.

157
12:47.320 --> 12:49.600
Ji An An passed away three years ago,

158
12:49.600 --> 12:52.000
and Ji Ning is three years old now.

159
12:52.000 --> 12:55.720
But... the child's father...

160
12:55.720 --> 12:58.400
Is Xiao Ning's biological father...

161
12:58.400 --> 12:59.479
Zhou Yang?

162
12:59.479 --> 13:01.459
Ji Ning's surname is Ji.

163
13:03.200 --> 13:05.899
The child has nothing to do with anyone else.

164
13:06.707 --> 13:09.127
This was also An An's wish.

165
13:12.640 --> 13:16.000
An An must have loved Xiao Ning very much.

166
13:16.000 --> 13:20.540
But to me, she was far too cruel.

167
13:37.360 --> 13:39.220
You still have me.

168
13:41.080 --> 13:43.059
I'll always be here.

169
14:00.039 --> 14:02.080
I'll be heading back.

170
14:02.080 --> 14:03.780
Okay.

171
14:04.440 --> 14:06.340
Are you still leaving today?

172
14:07.679 --> 14:10.100
I'll go and cancel my flight right now.

173
14:14.279 --> 14:18.073
I'll take you around over the next two days.

174
14:18.073 --> 14:20.480
Stay for a few more days.

175
14:20.480 --> 14:22.179
Okay.

176
14:27.519 --> 14:30.427
Wait for me at the hotel entrance at noon.

177
14:30.427 --> 14:32.366
Let's go grab lunch.

178
14:33.559 --> 14:35.672
But...

179
14:35.672 --> 14:37.853
there's one more thing you have to do.

180
14:38.840 --> 14:40.659
What is it?

181
14:42.360 --> 14:43.860
You have to draw the same thing.

182
14:43.860 --> 14:46.199
I'll check it at lunch.

183
14:47.519 --> 14:51.900
This is... my heart for you, Mr. Ji.

184
14:52.600 --> 14:54.000
Then, what about your heart?

185
14:54.000 --> 14:55.759
Of course, you'll draw that, too.

186
14:55.759 --> 14:57.860
My heart...

187
14:58.480 --> 15:00.541
Don't you already know where it is?

188
15:46.759 --> 15:48.240
Where's Xiao Ning?

189
15:48.240 --> 15:50.646
The nanny is looking after him.

190
15:50.646 --> 15:53.186
It's rare for us to have a date alone.

191
15:54.000 --> 15:56.220
Whatever you say, Mr. Ji.

192
16:13.000 --> 16:14.399
What's wrong?

193
16:14.399 --> 16:16.799
I'm checking to see if it's different.

194
16:16.799 --> 16:19.260
It's exactly the same, okay?

195
16:20.672 --> 16:22.371
Right.

196
16:23.440 --> 16:26.900
This... This isn't a good idea.

197
16:29.360 --> 16:31.179
So what?

198
16:37.159 --> 16:39.639
I might have to go back in a couple of days.

199
16:39.639 --> 16:40.840
If I don't go back soon,

200
16:40.840 --> 16:43.860
the team at my studio will go on strike.

201
16:44.520 --> 16:47.040
So, you even hired people to work for you.

202
16:47.040 --> 16:48.480
Men or women?

203
16:48.480 --> 16:50.720
A woman.

204
16:50.720 --> 16:53.660
She already has a boyfriend she's planning to marry.

205
16:55.559 --> 16:58.320
I haven't been back to H City for a long time.

206
16:58.320 --> 17:01.039
I wonder how much it's changed.

207
17:01.039 --> 17:03.980
Go back and see for yourself once you're done here.

208
17:04.760 --> 17:06.013
Okay.

209
17:06.013 --> 17:08.000
Once I've finished things here,

210
17:08.000 --> 17:09.200
I'll go there to find you.

211
17:09.200 --> 17:10.659
Okay.

212
17:45.519 --> 17:47.219
What's wrong?

213
17:49.359 --> 17:51.200
Nothing.

214
17:51.200 --> 17:53.739
Just some trouble I should have dealt with long ago.

215
18:00.640 --> 18:02.839
Mr. Shen, I missed you so much!

216
18:02.839 --> 18:04.319
Oh, my.

217
18:04.319 --> 18:06.620
Didn't we just see each other yesterday?

218
18:07.319 --> 18:09.840
I want to play with you every day.

219
18:09.840 --> 18:12.760
I'll play with you every day from now on, okay?

220
18:12.760 --> 18:13.773
Yay!

221
18:13.773 --> 18:15.839
I... I'll tell you a joke.

222
18:15.839 --> 18:17.640
- You're going to tell me one? - Yeah.

223
18:17.640 --> 18:19.240
What are you going to tell me? Go ahead.

224
18:19.240 --> 18:20.979
A joke.

225
18:21.599 --> 18:23.240
There was... there was a bird.

226
18:23.240 --> 18:25.399
It was a woodpecker.

227
18:25.399 --> 18:26.679
Uh-huh.

228
18:26.679 --> 18:29.199
It went to a tree to catch bugs.

229
18:29.199 --> 18:32.240
Then the tree said, "I'm not sick."

230
18:32.240 --> 18:33.760
And then...

231
18:33.760 --> 18:37.220
Then the woodpecker said, "If you're not sick, take a few steps."

232
18:41.919 --> 18:42.919
All right.

233
18:42.919 --> 18:44.760
It's time for bed.

234
18:44.760 --> 18:46.639
I want to hear a bedtime story.

235
18:46.639 --> 18:49.499
I want Mr. Shen to tell it to me.

236
18:50.360 --> 18:52.773
Okay, I'll tell you a story.

237
18:54.413 --> 18:56.033
Let's go.

238
18:57.159 --> 18:58.760
Mr. Shen, tell me the story of...

239
18:58.760 --> 19:01.940
the Big Bad Wolf and the Little White Rabbit.

240
19:02.679 --> 19:03.800
Okay.

241
19:03.800 --> 19:06.080
Once upon a time, there was a big bad wolf,

242
19:06.080 --> 19:08.539
and a little white rabbit.

243
19:37.800 --> 19:42.280
But in the end, the little white rabbit defeated the wolf

244
19:42.280 --> 19:44.140
and protected itself.

245
19:45.213 --> 19:48.492
It's different from the story Dad told me last time.

246
19:49.359 --> 19:52.599
What did Dad say last time?

247
19:52.599 --> 19:57.159
Dad said the wolf and the little rabbit will always be together.

248
19:57.159 --> 19:58.860
Dad.

249
20:00.280 --> 20:01.979
Dad.

250
20:06.119 --> 20:07.199
Dad is too tired.

251
20:07.199 --> 20:09.159
Let him sleep.

252
20:09.159 --> 20:10.519
You should sleep, too.

253
20:12.520 --> 20:14.221
Good boy.

254
20:57.000 --> 20:58.820
Long time no see.

255
20:59.925 --> 21:01.946
My dearest Mr. Ji.

256
21:34.560 --> 21:35.760
Just like that,

257
21:35.760 --> 21:38.240
I stayed on the island for a few more days.

258
21:38.240 --> 21:41.720
I had a great time with Ji Ming Xuan and his son.

259
21:41.720 --> 21:44.380
Then I booked my return ticket.

260
21:46.960 --> 21:49.292
I've been working overseas for the past few years.

261
21:49.292 --> 21:51.696
My focus has shifted abroad.

262
21:51.696 --> 21:55.126
I'll come back to find you when I'm done.

263
21:55.126 --> 21:56.159
Okay.

264
21:56.159 --> 21:57.940
I'll wait for you.

265
22:00.679 --> 22:03.320
Where are you going?

266
22:03.320 --> 22:04.762
I'm going home.

267
22:04.762 --> 22:08.119
When will you come back?

268
22:08.119 --> 22:10.839
I might not come back for a while.

269
22:10.839 --> 22:11.919
No!

270
22:11.919 --> 22:13.280
Can you please not leave?

271
22:13.280 --> 22:15.439
Can you come with me?

272
22:15.439 --> 22:16.919
I have to go back.

273
22:16.919 --> 22:19.760
But when the time comes, you can visit my house with your dad.

274
22:19.760 --> 22:21.000
- Okay? - Really?

275
22:21.000 --> 22:22.040
Then pinky swear.

276
22:22.040 --> 22:24.840
- Pinky swear. - Pinky swear, pinky swear.

277
22:24.840 --> 22:28.940
- Pinky swear. - If I lie, lies, you can punish me...

278
22:30.359 --> 22:31.919
by letting the big bad wolf take me away.

279
22:31.919 --> 22:34.040
Don't let the wolf take you away.

280
22:34.040 --> 22:36.359
Otherwise, I won't be able to see you.

281
22:36.359 --> 22:37.520
Dad has your photo.

282
22:37.520 --> 22:39.499
But I don't.

283
22:40.560 --> 22:42.800
What photo?

284
22:42.800 --> 22:46.099
The one Dad keeps in his wallet.

285
22:48.480 --> 22:49.560
That's enough, Xiao Ning.

286
22:49.560 --> 22:50.733
He is about to board his plane.

287
22:50.733 --> 22:52.119
Don't pester him anymore, okay?

288
22:52.119 --> 22:54.040
- Okay. - Good.

289
22:54.040 --> 22:55.119
Mr. Ji.

290
22:55.119 --> 22:56.999
What photo?

291
23:01.639 --> 23:03.800
I'm a bit thirsty. I'll go buy some water.

292
23:03.800 --> 23:07.159
Mr. Ji, can I borrow your wallet?

293
23:07.159 --> 23:09.019
I'll go buy it for you.

294
23:16.200 --> 23:17.879
No wonder Xiao Ning was so close to me

295
23:17.879 --> 23:19.359
the moment we met.

296
23:19.359 --> 23:21.359
It seems it wasn't for no reason.

297
23:21.359 --> 23:26.800
But... which photo of me is in Mr. Ji's wallet?

298
23:26.800 --> 23:28.480
I don't like taking photos.

299
23:28.480 --> 23:31.980
I don't recall ever taking one with him.

300
23:32.760 --> 23:34.280
The ones I took in the past

301
23:34.280 --> 23:37.159
were all left in that rental house.

302
23:37.159 --> 23:39.739
Where did Mr. Ji get a photo of me?

303
23:47.679 --> 23:49.359
So, what is that photo?

304
23:49.359 --> 23:50.760
Just let me have a look.

305
23:50.760 --> 23:51.960
Just one peek.

306
23:51.960 --> 23:54.359
There's no photo.

307
23:54.359 --> 23:56.280
Oh, come on, I'm begging you.

308
23:56.280 --> 23:59.320
Let me see it. I'm really curious.

309
23:59.320 --> 24:01.760
Curiosity killed the cat.

310
24:01.760 --> 24:03.240
I'm about to board the plane.

311
24:03.240 --> 24:04.639
You wouldn't have the heart to let me

312
24:04.639 --> 24:07.299
spend the whole flight thinking about it.

313
24:08.119 --> 24:10.480
Xiao Ning, tell me.

314
24:10.480 --> 24:12.900
Is it a good photo?

315
24:15.520 --> 24:17.341
All right, Xiao Ning.

316
24:21.760 --> 24:23.460
It's very nice.

317
24:25.159 --> 24:27.579
That's not what I'm asking.

318
24:28.280 --> 24:29.838
All right.

319
24:29.838 --> 24:31.658
It's time for you to go.

320
24:34.679 --> 24:36.240
I'm leaving now.

321
24:36.240 --> 24:37.280
Bye, Xiao Ning.

322
24:37.280 --> 24:39.940
Goodbye, Mr. Shen.

323
24:41.713 --> 24:43.413
Bye-bye.

324
25:00.639 --> 25:01.960
Boss.

325
25:01.960 --> 25:03.839
You're finally back.

326
25:03.839 --> 25:05.960
What took you so long this time?

327
25:05.960 --> 25:08.159
Well... I was enjoying myself,

328
25:08.159 --> 25:10.599
so I stayed a few extra days.

329
25:10.599 --> 25:12.679
A few extra days?

330
25:12.679 --> 25:15.140
Did you have a romantic encounter?

331
25:15.800 --> 25:17.879
A romantic encounter?

332
25:17.879 --> 25:21.240
Ji Ming Xuan and I reunited after years.

333
25:21.240 --> 25:22.439
Does that count as a romantic encounter?

334
25:22.439 --> 25:23.639
Anyway, don't overthink it.

335
25:23.639 --> 25:24.679
Get back to work.

336
25:24.679 --> 25:26.280
Students will be on break in a few days.

337
25:26.280 --> 25:28.159
Many will surely want to learn painting.

338
25:28.159 --> 25:30.779
Let's get the word out.

339
25:31.399 --> 25:34.119
We might get more business that way.

340
25:34.119 --> 25:37.919
Boss, what's with you all of a sudden?

341
25:37.919 --> 25:41.000
Don't we usually slack off whenever we can?

342
25:41.000 --> 25:43.720
Why have you suddenly become so diligent?

343
25:43.720 --> 25:46.399
I'm not that lazy.

344
25:46.399 --> 25:49.800
Besides, things are different now.

345
25:49.800 --> 25:51.520
How so?

346
25:51.520 --> 25:53.600
Because...

347
25:53.600 --> 25:56.279
I have a family to support now.

348
25:56.279 --> 25:57.980
What?

349
26:01.960 --> 26:05.599
Are... Are you getting married?

350
26:05.599 --> 26:06.760
How did this happen?

351
26:06.760 --> 26:10.119
Did you fall in love at first sight abroad?

352
26:10.119 --> 26:11.120
I knew it!

353
26:11.120 --> 26:14.000
A romantic meeting by the sea,

354
26:14.000 --> 26:15.760
just like in the movies, right?

355
26:15.760 --> 26:16.760
What is she like?

356
26:16.760 --> 26:19.520
Is she pretty? Does she have a good temper?

357
26:19.520 --> 26:22.240
Just go and finish the cleaning.

358
26:22.240 --> 26:24.499
Look how dirty the floor is.

359
26:25.919 --> 26:27.159
Okay.

360
26:27.159 --> 26:29.359
Someone's coming over later.

361
26:29.359 --> 26:31.220
Is it the "boss lady"?

362
26:31.919 --> 26:34.080
Go clean up.

363
26:34.080 --> 26:35.819
On it!

364
26:44.199 --> 26:46.399
Hello. Welcome to Mo Studio.

365
26:46.399 --> 26:48.499
How can I help you?

366
26:49.119 --> 26:51.860
Boss, he's here to see you.

367
26:59.100 --> 27:01.150
W-Wait a minute... Holy cow!

368
27:02.639 --> 27:04.339
It's you!

369
27:05.199 --> 27:07.099
So, you're the boss's...

370
27:10.960 --> 27:12.320
Hello.

371
27:12.320 --> 27:14.280
You must be Yang Yue.

372
27:14.280 --> 27:16.900
Hello, boss lady!

373
27:17.606 --> 27:19.240
That's right.

374
27:19.240 --> 27:20.839
I'm the boss.

375
27:20.839 --> 27:23.019
Aren't you the boss's wife?

376
27:24.199 --> 27:25.760
I'll leave you two alone now.

377
27:25.760 --> 27:27.380
Bye!

378
27:29.960 --> 27:31.000
Where's Xiao Ning?

379
27:31.000 --> 27:33.560
Why didn't he come with you?

380
27:33.560 --> 27:35.420
He's playing at home.

381
27:37.520 --> 27:38.879
Oh, right.

382
27:38.879 --> 27:40.280
You can't run away now.

383
27:40.280 --> 27:41.839
Quick, tell me.

384
27:41.839 --> 27:44.119
What photo of me did you hide?

385
27:44.119 --> 27:45.119
How do you still remember that?

386
27:45.119 --> 27:46.599
I just do.

387
27:46.599 --> 27:48.499
Let me see it.

388
27:56.480 --> 27:59.078
This is so ugly!

389
27:59.078 --> 28:00.526
It's not ugly at all.

390
28:00.526 --> 28:02.040
It's very cute.

391
28:02.040 --> 28:03.639
You have no idea.

392
28:03.639 --> 28:05.840
During the years you were gone,

393
28:05.840 --> 28:08.740
this was the only thing that kept me going.

394
28:10.199 --> 28:14.760
But wait, this was taken when I was in school.

395
28:14.760 --> 28:16.819
Where did you get it?

396
28:17.960 --> 28:20.520
I bet you don't remember,

397
28:20.520 --> 28:22.439
but you once submitted a resume...

398
28:22.439 --> 28:24.560
to my company.

399
28:24.560 --> 28:26.259
Huh?

400
28:30.880 --> 28:35.620
But after all that, you still ended up being mine.

401
28:36.919 --> 28:38.779
I did not!

402
28:40.280 --> 28:41.980
What are you laughing at?

403
28:42.646 --> 28:44.639
You definitely don't remember.

404
28:44.639 --> 28:47.380
I actually saw you a long time ago.

405
28:48.080 --> 28:51.080
Wasn't the first time we met when you saved me?

406
28:51.080 --> 28:53.345
I was at T University to pick up An An.

407
28:53.345 --> 28:55.740
You were riding a bicycle,

408
28:55.740 --> 28:59.499
loaded with paints and art supplies.

409
29:04.119 --> 29:05.160
Oh my gosh.

410
29:05.160 --> 29:07.160
I must have looked so stupid.

411
29:07.160 --> 29:08.199
How embarrassing.

412
29:08.199 --> 29:10.299
Was I really that clumsy back then?

413
29:19.839 --> 29:21.480
Okay.

414
29:21.480 --> 29:23.760
I'll be right there.

415
29:23.760 --> 29:25.460
What's wrong?

416
29:27.543 --> 29:28.985
Don't worry.

417
29:28.985 --> 29:31.840
Just a small matter at work.

418
29:31.840 --> 29:34.439
When I'm finished, I'll come pick you up tonight.

419
29:34.439 --> 29:36.633
Okay. Be safe then.

420
29:36.633 --> 29:38.220
Yeah.

421
29:52.399 --> 29:54.439
Boss, you're so lucky.

422
29:54.439 --> 29:55.879
He's so handsome.

423
29:55.879 --> 29:58.439
Why do you keep popping up like that?

424
29:58.439 --> 30:00.360
Sorry.

425
30:00.360 --> 30:03.480
Oh, right. I forgot to tell you something.

426
30:03.480 --> 30:04.679
What is it?

427
30:04.679 --> 30:07.359
Someone came looking for you a couple of days ago.

428
30:07.359 --> 30:08.679
- Looking for me? - Yeah.

429
30:08.679 --> 30:09.880
Who was it?

430
30:09.880 --> 30:13.560
He was quite tall, and a pretty handsome guy.

431
30:13.560 --> 30:15.399
Oh, but not as tall as your partner.

432
30:15.399 --> 30:17.160
And not as handsome as him either.

433
30:17.160 --> 30:18.839
Uh, he wore glasses.

434
30:18.839 --> 30:21.932
His name is... Zhou Yang.

435
30:24.680 --> 30:27.258
What did he want with me?

436
30:27.258 --> 30:28.520
He didn't say.

437
30:28.520 --> 30:31.359
He just said you must contact him when you get back.

438
30:31.359 --> 30:34.000
He kept reminding me over and over.

439
30:34.000 --> 30:36.220
It must be something urgent.

440
30:37.919 --> 30:39.679
Zhou Yang.

441
30:39.679 --> 30:42.940
What is he up to, appearing out of the blue like this?
